      "review_notes": "Reciprocal rejection of Geometric(1-p) proposals has mass ((1-p)/p)*(-log(1-p)); normalizing and shifting gives the standard positive-integer logarithmic-series PMF p^(n+1)/((n+1)*(-log(1-p))). The shared AcceptedProposal identity supplies the sole retry-conservation step. CTE performs one geometric proposal, one reciprocal rational coin, and an immediate return or amplified retry. Tests check the first atom at p1/2, no zero atom including infinite credit there, constant infinite expectation and generic resource framing."
    },
